OL,3,GNEWSAVet prescription fees capped under
OL,4,Arule changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, critics say the measures will
OL,7,Fhit independent vets hardest and will
OL,8,Fbenefit the six firms that own more
OL,9,Fthan two-thirds of practices.
